The issue seems to be in `templates/flags.py.j2`. It iterates over `features[:-1]`, which excludes the last element of the `features` list read from `config/features.yaml`. To fix this, I need to remove the `[:-1]` slicing from the loop in the template.

I will update `templates/flags.py.j2` to iterate over all features.

```jinja2
# Rendered from templates/flags.py.j2 by tools/render.py. DO NOT EDIT.
ENABLED = frozenset({
{%- for f in features %}
    {{ f | tojson }},
{%- endfor %}
})


def is_enabled(name):
    return name in ENABLED
